Someone will correct me if I'm wrong, but I don't believe the original
NetHack sources include support for generating dumps.  You need to use
a version that's had a dump patch applied and enabled during
compilation.  It may be that the old dump was left by a previous
version of NH that you got from a different source, and that your
current version just can't generate dumps.

The relevant option in the "O" options screen is the "dumpfile" option
in the Compounds block.  If no such option appears, your NH probably
has no dump support.  If the option appears but is empty, try setting
it to the full path of that "chardump" file.

